- (B) <u>Content. Such notice shall include:</u> 

((a))   agency name; ((b))   PIN; ((c))   title and/or brief description of the goods, services, or construction to be procured; 

((d))   estimated quantity, if any; 

((e))   how the solicitation documents may be obtained; 

((f))   date and time by which, and the location where, bids must be submitted and will be publicly opened and if applicable, a link to access the livestreaming of the opening, reading, and identification of bids on a publicly accessible website; and ((g))   required vendor qualifications or eligibility requirements, if any and 

((h))   A statement, if applicable, that the solicitation is subject to Section 6-129 of the Administrative Code (M/WBE and EBE program).
